MID_Roster_Career_Die_003: Is held responsible for the failure and barely escapes being sacrificed.
MID_Roster_Career_Die_004: Is saved by Orchel, spurring him to swear lifelong loyalty.
MID_Roster_Career_Die_007: Travels to Dagsion as Orchel's bodyguard.
MID_Roster_Career_Die_008: Joins up with the Promised One, who appeared in Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Die_009: Survives the bloodshed of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Die_010: At Credna's temple, continues waiting for Orchel's return.
MID_Roster_Career_Lor_001: Born in Breston, the royal capital, and abandoned by her parents.
MID_Roster_Career_Lor_002: Is caught for theft, but shown mercy and sent to Credna's temple.
MID_Roster_Career_Lor_003: Placed under the supervision of Buspha, undergoes strict training.
MID_Roster_Career_Lor_004: Gets sent to accompany Orchel on Buspha's orders.
MID_Roster_Career_Lor_007: Accompanies Orchel on the journey to Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Lor_008: Rushes to Dagsion after hearing about the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Lor_009: Survives the bloodshed of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Lor_010: Stays by Ozin's side at Credna's temple to fight the underworld armies.
MID_Roster_Career_Set_001: Crosses the sea from Fódlan to do research.
MID_Roster_Career_Set_002: Lands in the north of Dagda and begins heading west.
MID_Roster_Career_Set_003: Runs into Orchel, who saves him from wild animals.
MID_Roster_Career_Set_006: Agrees to Credna's request to accompany Orchel on her journey.
MID_Roster_Career_Set_007: Enters the Heroic Games with Orchel.
MID_Roster_Career_Set_008: Heads to Dagsion to investigate the Promise One's appearance.
MID_Roster_Career_Set_009: Survives the bloodshed of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Set_010: Fights the underworld armies from Credna's temple.
MID_Roster_Career_Nin_001: Born as the daughter of Nomved.
MID_Roster_Career_Nin_002: Loses her mother as she's being born.
MID_Roster_Career_Nin_003: Recognized for her abilities, becomes a vulkan at Credna's temple.
MID_Roster_Career_Nin_004: Comes to be known and feared as the Angel of Death.
MID_Roster_Career_Nin_007: Begins to accompany Orchel in order to protect her.
MID_Roster_Career_Nin_008: Departs Credna's temple to find the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Nin_009: Survives the bloodshed of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Nin_010: Fights the underworld armies from Credna's temple.
MID_Roster_Career_Naz_001: Manufactured as a spare Mediator in the village of Kunlun.
MID_Roster_Career_Naz_002: Begins living with Sha Lan and receives an education.
MID_Roster_Career_Naz_003: Learns martial arts from Long.
MID_Roster_Career_Naz_006: Joins Anatolia's journey as her guardian.
MID_Roster_Career_Naz_007: Enters the Heroic Games at Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Naz_008: Heads to Dagsion to join the Promised One's forces.
MID_Roster_Career_Naz_009: Survives the bloodshed of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Naz_010: Fights to protect his kin.
MID_Roster_Career_Sar_001: Born in the village of Kunlun.
MID_Roster_Career_Sar_002: Loses her biological sister, Rui Ji.
MID_Roster_Career_Sar_003: Becomes like a big sister to the children of the village.
MID_Roster_Career_Sar_004: Treats Anatolia like a younger sibling.
MID_Roster_Career_Sar_006: Joins Anatolia's journey as her guardian.
MID_Roster_Career_Sar_007: Enters the Heroic Games at Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Sar_008: Heads to Dagsion once the Promised One is ready to travel.
MID_Roster_Career_Sar_009: Observes how the Dagdan War unfolds.
MID_Roster_Career_Sar_010: Helps Anatolia protect the land of Solomon.
MID_Roster_Career_Dai_001: Born in the village of Kunlun.
MID_Roster_Career_Dai_002: Loses his father.
MID_Roster_Career_Dai_003: Loses his mother.
MID_Roster_Career_Dai_004: Isolates from his village and begins living alone.
MID_Roster_Career_Dai_006: When Anatolia departs, joins her on her journey.
MID_Roster_Career_Dai_007: Enters the Heroic Games at Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Dai_008: Follows the Promised One to Dagsion, in search of a place to shine.
MID_Roster_Career_Dai_009: Survives the bloodshed of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Dai_010: Fights to protect his kin.
MID_Roster_Career_Hal_001: Born to a family of farmers, the eldest daughter among six siblings.
MID_Roster_Career_Hal_002: Chooses to leave her home so there will be one less mouth to feed.
MID_Roster_Career_Hal_003: Is tricked by a devious recruiter but escapes capture.
MID_Roster_Career_Hal_004: Joins Nasshim's Circus and travels with them.
MID_Roster_Career_Hal_005: Learns how to perform and fight from Nasshim and the others.
MID_Roster_Career_Hal_006: Gets attacked by bandits, but is saved by Anatolia and her friends.
MID_Roster_Career_Hal_007: Joins Anatolia's journey and heads to Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Hal_008: Heads to Dagsion to offer her support to the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Hal_009: Survives the bloodshed of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Hal_010: Inspires citizens scared of the underworld army with her performances.
MID_Roster_Career_Guj_001: Born as the second son of a tenant farmer in the borderlands.
MID_Roster_Career_Guj_002: Settles in Dagsion, making a living as a mercenary.
MID_Roster_Career_Guj_003: Grows stronger through countless chaotic battles.
MID_Roster_Career_Guj_004: Becomes known among other mercenaries as the Unkillable Guzran.
MID_Roster_Career_Guj_008: Departs for his former home after hearing about the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Guj_009: Fights in the Dagdan War, amusing others with his boasts.
MID_Roster_Career_Guj_010: Continues mercenary work, defeating underworld soldiers.
MID_Roster_Career_Yan_001: Born in the Hidden Village of Bombae.
MID_Roster_Career_Yan_002: Serves at Jurah's temple in Tellus.
MID_Roster_Career_Yan_003: Feeling restless, he quits and sets out wandering the land.
MID_Roster_Career_Yan_004: Lives for a time in the land of Sai to the east.
MID_Roster_Career_Yan_005: Stops off at Dagsion during his travels.
MID_Roster_Career_Yan_008: Meets the Promised One by chance while wandering through Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Yan_009: Survives the bloodshed of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Yan_010: Becomes a traveling preacher to heal others' despair.
MID_Roster_Career_Iio_001: Born into a family of knights in the kingdom of Arago.
MID_Roster_Career_Iio_002: Begins serving as a knight, replacing his late father.
MID_Roster_Career_Iio_003: Gets fed up with the king and leaves Arago.
MID_Roster_Career_Iio_004: Wanders from place to place, making a living as a mercenary.
MID_Roster_Career_Iio_005: During a stop in Dagsion, decides to stay in the city.
MID_Roster_Career_Iio_008: Heads back to the capital after hearing about the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Iio_009: Survives the bloodshed of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Iio_010: Searches for the ideal liege while fighting the underworld armies.
MID_Roster_Career_Pep_001: Born the son of the king of Brigid, Peregrinus.
MID_Roster_Career_Pep_002: Learns the ways of kingcraft from childhood.
MID_Roster_Career_Pep_003: Inherits the throne of Brigid from his father.
MID_Roster_Career_Pep_004: Leaving politics to his father, travels to Dagda to learn its culture.
MID_Roster_Career_Pep_005: Receives help from Ultand to learn Dagdan ways.
MID_Roster_Career_Pep_008: Sets out to join the Promised One in Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Pep_009: Participates in the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Pep_010: Continues to fight the armies of the underworld in the land of Dagda.
MID_Roster_Career_Noc_001: Born to the chief of the Asherah.
MID_Roster_Career_Noc_002: Spends her childhood dreaming of seeing the glamors of the city.
MID_Roster_Career_Noc_003: Tires of country life, leaving her village for the city.
MID_Roster_Career_Noc_004: Earns a living as a gladiator in Dagsion, the city of her dreams.
MID_Roster_Career_Noc_005: Loses her affiliation after punching an irritating employer.
MID_Roster_Career_Noc_008: Makes for Dagsion to fight at the Promised One's side.
MID_Roster_Career_Noc_009: Serves in the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Noc_010: Lives her days fighting the underworld armies in Brezarant.
MID_Roster_Career_Sop_001: Born to a bandit at Lyoshan Fort.
MID_Roster_Career_Sop_002: Spends her childhood among ruffians.
MID_Roster_Career_Sop_003: Gets sent with her younger brother to Aguiño, where her mother lives.
MID_Roster_Career_Sop_004: Leaves the village she'd grown used to and moves to Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Sop_005: Begins serving as a priest in Solel's temple, anticipating good pay.
MID_Roster_Career_Sop_008: Heads for Dagsion to pledge service to the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Sop_009: Survives the bloodshed of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Sop_010: Heals people wounded by the underworld army.
MID_Roster_Career_Cat_001: Born into a knight's house in Kassite.
MID_Roster_Career_Cat_002: Loses everything in the Cydonia Massacre.
MID_Roster_Career_Cat_003: Abandons her birthplace, wandering in search of a good employer.
MID_Roster_Career_Cat_004: Drifts to Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Cat_008: Travels to Dagsion to offer her help to the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Cat_009: Takes part in the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Cat_010: Battles the underworld army across the land.
MID_Roster_Career_Ned_001: Born into a prestigious house in the kingdom of Saramis.
MID_Roster_Career_Ned_002: Loses her lord after Dyan's rebellion fails.
MID_Roster_Career_Ned_003: Departs Saramis to travel the land.
MID_Roster_Career_Ned_004: Sets up in Dagsion and makes a living as a mercenary.
MID_Roster_Career_Ned_008: Travels to Dagsion to fight alongside the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Ned_009: Serves in the Dagdan War, supporting those around her.
MID_Roster_Career_Ned_010: Fights the underworld army in Saramis.
MID_Roster_Career_Zac_001: Abandoned on a mountain soon after birth and found by bandits.
MID_Roster_Career_Zac_002: Learns the ways of killing from the bandits.
MID_Roster_Career_Zac_003: Terrorizes travelers as the head of a brutal bandit gang.
MID_Roster_Career_Zac_004: Hearing about the Heroic Games, heads to Dagsion to join.
MID_Roster_Career_Zac_008: Heads to Dagsion to get in good with the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Zac_009: Robs battlefields during the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Zac_010: Makes a living scavenging destroyed villages.
MID_Roster_Career_Maj_001: Born in Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Maj_002: Gets disowned by his parents for his rambunctious behavior.
MID_Roster_Career_Maj_003: Is repeatedly jailed for committing violent crimes in the city.
MID_Roster_Career_Maj_004: Gets seen by the Order of Mithras and given one of Drake's treasures.
MID_Roster_Career_Maj_008: Goes to Dagsion to meet his new rival, the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Maj_009: Participates (in his own way) in the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Maj_010: Earns money by thoroughly routing the underworld armies.
MID_Roster_Career_Ven_001: Born the child of commoners.
MID_Roster_Career_Ven_002: Is appointed a centurion for the temples.
MID_Roster_Career_Ven_003: Loses his place after a scandal.
MID_Roster_Career_Ven_004: Spends time as a gladiator under Poloni's discretion.
MID_Roster_Career_Ven_005: Forms a mercenary group of soldiers disguised as bandits.
MID_Roster_Career_Ven_008: Joins forces with the Promised One, unable to stand by idly.
MID_Roster_Career_Ven_009: Charges eagerly into battle during the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Ven_010: Leads a fierce rebel army against the underworld forces.
MID_Roster_Career_Ini_001: Born into an ordinary family in Bragança.
MID_Roster_Career_Ini_002: Shows talent with a bow from an early age, earning others' attention.
MID_Roster_Career_Ini_003: Begins her career as a novice mercenary.
MID_Roster_Career_Ini_004: Meets the Order of Mithras and receives Ugo's Bow.
MID_Roster_Career_Ini_005: Acting completely changed, makes a name for herself.
MID_Roster_Career_Ini_008: Heads for Dagsion, pinning her hopes on the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Ini_009: In her downcast state, fights and survives through the Dagdan War.
