MID_Roster_Career_Jas_001: Born into a house of warriors in Brigid.
MID_Roster_Career_Jas_002: Emigrates to Dagda and gets hired by an Aragonian noble.
MID_Roster_Career_Jas_003: Takes part in Arago's invasion of Cydonia.
MID_Roster_Career_Jas_004: After the house she served falls, starts a mercenary group with friends.
MID_Roster_Career_Jas_005: Has her family of mercenaries temporarily disband.
MID_Roster_Career_Jas_008: Hears about the Promised One and joins up quickly.
MID_Roster_Career_Jas_009: Participates in the Dagdan War and performs well.
MID_Roster_Career_Jas_010: Fights to protect the land her late spouse loved.
MID_Roster_Career_Ale_001: Born as the daughter of the viceroy of Tellus.
MID_Roster_Career_Ale_002: Loses her parents and goes to live with her uncle.
MID_Roster_Career_Ale_003: At her uncle's direction, becomes a knight in Jurah's temple.
MID_Roster_Career_Ale_004: Distinguishes herself early on and earns the title Silver Maiden.
MID_Roster_Career_Ale_008: Sensing the Promised One, gets Jurah's permission to go to Dagsion.
MID_Roster_Career_Ale_009: Fights gallantly amidst the outbreak of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Ale_010: Fights the underworld army from Jurah's temple.
