MID_Roster_Career_Nuz_004: Leads his tribe into hiding near Ahm Lu.
MID_Roster_Career_Nuz_008: Decides to break faith with Balor and join the Promised One.
MID_Roster_Career_Nuz_009: Witnesses firsthand the entirety of the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Nuz_010: Having reunited with Saramis, continues to fight alongside his kin.
