MID_Roster_Career_Nat_004: Fights alongside Creek in battles across the kingdom.
MID_Roster_Career_Nat_005: Makes a name as one of the Twin Jewels of Arago.
MID_Roster_Career_Nat_008: Returns to the Promised One's side to join their cause.
MID_Roster_Career_Nat_009: Serves as a general for the empire in the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Nat_010: Under Queen Aswan, protects the country from the underworld army.
