MID_Roster_Career_Hri_002: For his brilliance, receives an appointment as a knight.
MID_Roster_Career_Hri_003: Becomes likened to a pantere.
MID_Roster_Career_Hri_004: Fights alongside Nathan in battles across the kingdom.
MID_Roster_Career_Hri_005: Makes a name as one of the Twin Jewels of Arago.
MID_Roster_Career_Hri_008: Goes to Dagsion to lend the Promised One his strength.
MID_Roster_Career_Hri_009: Serves as a general for the empire in the Dagdan War.
MID_Roster_Career_Hri_010: Under Queen Aswan, protects the country from the underworld army.
